$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=zdmpsum  LOC_AFTER=?

* Mertens second theorem, upper form with explicit constant: the sum of the reciprocals of the primes up to N is at most log log N + ( 1 + 2 ( log 4 + 4 ) / log 2 - log log 2 ) (Lean sum_prime_inv_le).

